#. Plugin header
msgid "Adds features to the WordPress admin area, module by module: back-to-top button, sticky save bar, notice organizer, color theme and a sample customization. Each module can be turned on or off. Adds nothing to the front end; connects to GitHub only for the plugin catalog (can be turned off in the settings)."
